    { "_comment": "Below: the 'adjacent' track. These fund a cause, not journalism — but reporting, public information and community education are routinely eligible activities. None of them appear on journalism grant lists, which is the point." },

    { "_comment": "Aggregators first. A funder's own homepage rarely carries its open call; an aggregator carries a hundred funders' calls on one page, which is why the media track leans on GIJN and IJNet. The adjacent track needs the same." },
